    "text": "I, Harin Fernando, Minister of Telecommunication, Foreign Employment and Sports in terms of Powers vested in meunder Sports Act, No. 25 of 1973 do hereby lift the Registration suspended by the Gazette Notification (Extraordinary)No. 2110/40 dated 14.02.2019, of the Sri Lanka Badminton Association with effect from 21.06.2019 and entrustadministration and the functions thereof, with the office bearers of the Sri Lanka Badminton Association which has beenlawfully elected, with effect from the above date.",
